有没有学霸可教我一下？ https://t.co/E2a2ym26Td","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097982077153186132"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-10T01:21:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097857939310883141"],"id":"2097857939310883141","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":33,"impression_count":107566,"like_count":756,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":420,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我上职高班里有个女的，文文静静的，被校园霸凌拍了那种照片，不知道为什么被发班群里了，她报警了，警察来了，学校说“会处理”。但是我们都不知道怎么处理的，那女的退学了，听说她后来抑郁了。我不知道她现在还在不在.......","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097857939310883141"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-09T14:22:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097692082630791433"],"id":"2097692082630791433","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":63316,"like_count":138,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":319,"retweet_count":0},"text":"07年辍学送外卖第二年了，挺后悔当初没继续读书的，如果去读书，我最次现在也应该是一个护士了，而且最少也是专科级别的学历，不至于只能干着送外卖，端盘子，服务员等这类工作了","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097692082630791433"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-08T10:43:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2097274718642708778"],"id":"2097274718642708778","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":64571,"like_count":169,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":253,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我都19了还是改不掉睡觉流口水的坏毛病... https://t.co/7us3wvrwwJ","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2097274718642708778"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-09-07T09:51:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096899084594598279"],"id":"2096899084594598279","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":38258,"like_count":47,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":0},"text":"真空出门回到家下面湿透了，原本只是想浅浅的尝试一下真空，没想到策底爱上这种刺激的感觉了，尤其走在人群中又害羞又胆怯和第一次谈恋爱一样","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2096899084594598279"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-07-25T14:24:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2081022782511730971"],"id":"2081022782511730971","pub